{"id":"473280","name":"鲜美豆腐汤","author":"呼噜娃哈哈","authorId":"10461722","desc":"","cover":"images/473280/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"山水豆腐","amount":"200g"},{"name":"虾","amount":"八只"},{"name":"番茄","amount":"一个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一只"}],"sub":[{"name":"大蒜","amount":"三瓣"},{"name":"香油","amount":"一勺"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"一勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"把山水豆腐洗干净。","img":"images/473280/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切小块，豆腐很嫩，容易碎，切的时候要小心。","img":"images/473280/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"番茄切小块。","img":"images/473280/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"中午吃剩的虾去壳，待用。","img":"images/473280/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"大蒜切片。","img":"images/473280/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鸡蛋搅均匀。","img":"images/473280/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"淀粉一勺，加半碗水搅匀。","img":"images/473280/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅内放油，油热后放入蒜片，翻炒。","img":"images/473280/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入番茄块，翻炒两分钟。","img":"images/473280/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加适量水，一般几个人喝就加几碗水。","img":"images/473280/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"水开后煮一分钟，倒入豆腐。","img":"images/473280/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"煮沸后，加入淀粉水。","img":"images/473280/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"煮开后倒入蛋液，加了淀粉水的蛋液不容易煮散，而且豆腐容易入味。","img":"images/473280/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"煮沸后，放入虾仁。","img":"images/473280/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加适量盐和香油，装碗，开喝！","img":"images/473280/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}